  "description": "TOON (Token-Oriented Object Notation) serialization for .NET, implementing TOON spec v3.3.2 and tested against the official conformance fixtures. System.Text.Json-style ToonSerializer with cached metadata and compiled accessors, async and multi-document streaming, and a ToonDocument/ToonValue model. Useful for compact, LLM-friendly payloads, configuration files and data exchange.",
